# ============================================================
# OpenFOAM / CFD project .gitignore
# Keep source code, dictionaries, scripts, 0/, 0.orig/, and
# intentionally versioned constant/polyMesh/ directories tracked.
# ============================================================

# === OpenFOAM build artifacts ===
# wmake platform-specific dependency/build directories
Make/*/
lnInclude/
*.o
*.dep
*.a
*.so
*.dylib

# Optional general build directories
build/
cmake-build-*/
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
cmake_install.cmake
compile_commands.json

# === OpenFOAM decomposition and solver outputs ===
# Parallel decomposition directories
processor[0-9]*/
processors[0-9]*/

# Solver logs and OpenFOAM-generated visualisation marker files
log.*
*.log
*.foam

# Generated post-processing and VTK exports
postProcessing/
VTK/
*.vtk
*.vtkjs
*.vtm
*.vtu
*.pvtu
*.pvd
*.case
*.ensight

# Rendered/generated media. Remove a rule below if a particular file
# is intentionally maintained as project documentation.
*.avi
*.mp4
*.mov
*.gif

# Numbered OpenFOAM time directories from solver runs.
# This retains the initial-condition directories 0/ and 0.orig/.
# Examples ignored: 0.001/, 1/, 10/, 2500/.
[1-9]*/
[0-9]*.[0-9]*/

# === Generated archives / temporary simulation data ===
*.tar.gz
*.tar
*.zip
*.bak
*.orig
*.tmp

# === Python / Jupyter ===
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# === OS / editor clutter ===
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# === Intentionally not ignored globally ===
# constant/polyMesh/ is NOT ignored: some cases ship an essential,
# pre-generated mesh. For a specific case whose mesh is regenerated locally,
# add a .gitignore inside that case directory containing:
# constant/polyMesh/
#
# Likewise, CSV and PNG files are not globally ignored because selected
# post-processing results/figures may be valuable project artefacts.
